1
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:43,030
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:43,720
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:45,880
[Episode 21]

4
00:01:56,350 --> 00:01:57,150
Li Si,

5
00:01:57,710 --> 00:01:58,430
is the one in front of you

6
00:01:58,430 --> 00:02:00,000
your master, Li San?

7
00:02:08,150 --> 00:02:10,240
Li Si has harbored a major criminal

8
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,640
and colluded with Liluo.

9
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,870
He is hereby stripped of
his post as Divine Constable

10
00:02:13,870 --> 00:02:16,400
and shall receive the same sentence
as the major criminal!

11
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,190
Chief!

12
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,860
Take him alive.

13
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:21,180
Yes!

14
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:21,710
Yes.

15
00:03:19,430 --> 00:03:21,680
The enemy who murdered your entire family

16
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,910
is already dead.

17
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,000
He's gotten

18
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,600
the punishment he deserved.

19
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,360
Give me the body.

20
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:29,000
He raised me for many years.

21
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:32,360
I will never let his remains

22
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,710
be desecrated by others.

23
00:03:36,030 --> 00:03:37,000
Desecrated?

24
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,490
My parents' bodies

25
00:03:38,510 --> 00:03:40,030
were left without burial for years.

26
00:03:40,030 --> 00:03:41,030
My younger brother, Shen Lan—

27
00:03:41,030 --> 00:03:41,840
to this day

28
00:03:41,870 --> 00:03:43,170
I don't even know where his body lies!

29
00:03:43,170 --> 00:03:43,930
And he

30
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:46,000
gets to die and have it all end there?

31
00:04:11,030 --> 00:04:12,560
Your brother's body

32
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:15,280
is now lying in the imperial mausoleum.

33
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,560
He died...

34
00:04:18,390 --> 00:04:20,600
in place of a man named Zhou Yan.

35
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,390
Zhou Yan?

36
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,640
The Fourth Prince, Zhou Yan?

37
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,800
How do you know?

38
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:26,830
Meng Rui,

39
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,070
if you think

40
00:04:29,100 --> 00:04:31,230
killing my master alone is not enough,

41
00:04:31,830 --> 00:04:33,600
kill me too.

42
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,040
I only hope

43
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,480
you won't spend the rest of your life

44
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,240
consumed by hatred,

45
00:04:39,510 --> 00:04:40,240
and that you won't

46
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,900
become someone like Tang Wei.

47
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,390
Who are you, really?

48
00:04:57,870 --> 00:04:58,920
The Reaper Sword

49
00:05:00,430 --> 00:05:02,430
is the most sinister blade in the world.

50
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:05,240
You've already been driven by hatred,

51
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,430
and your sword heart
has fallen into darkness.

52
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:07,800
If you take it one step further,

53
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:09,040
you will reach the Demon Sword realm—
a state

54
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,870
where all human attachments
and emotions are severed.

55
00:05:10,870 --> 00:05:11,930
When that happens,

56
00:05:12,830 --> 00:05:14,600
you will lose your reason

57
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,040
and become a murderous demon

58
00:05:17,190 --> 00:05:19,190
like your master, Dao Yin.

59
00:05:19,190 --> 00:05:20,160
Tell me,

60
00:05:20,630 --> 00:05:22,040
who are you really?

61
00:06:28,430 --> 00:06:29,430
Meng Rui, stop!

62
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:35,920
Qingyang.

63
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:37,560
Meng Rui.

64
00:06:40,159 --> 00:06:42,130
You stabbed me with your sword

65
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:44,190
when we first met.

66
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:46,870
Now,

67
00:06:49,430 --> 00:06:50,630
you've done it again.

68
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:28,280
Li Qingyang!

69
00:07:28,310 --> 00:07:29,120
Li Qingyang!

70
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:29,920
Qingyang!

71
00:07:31,310 --> 00:07:32,110
Qingyang!

72
00:07:38,190 --> 00:07:39,220
Qingyang!

73
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,500
Li Si!

74
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,650
Li Si!

75
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,040
Li Si!

76
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,800
Meng Rui!

77
00:08:03,510 --> 00:08:04,640
Li Si!

78
00:08:05,310 --> 00:08:06,800
Li Si!

79
00:08:06,830 --> 00:08:07,800
Meng Rui!

80
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,460
Your Highness.

81
00:09:06,510 --> 00:09:07,520
My princess consort.

82
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:09,920
[Ji Hongyi, Princess Ding]

83
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:11,480
No.

84
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,670
I'm no longer Prince Ding.

85
00:09:15,510 --> 00:09:16,910
Why are you still here?

86
00:09:17,830 --> 00:09:18,670
Go.

87
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:20,730
Your Highness,

88
00:09:20,750 --> 00:09:22,870
my family was short-sighted
and even went so far as

89
00:09:22,870 --> 00:09:24,320
to smuggle government salt,

90
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:26,150
dragging Your Highness down with them.

91
00:09:26,150 --> 00:09:27,720
I can only atone

92
00:09:28,870 --> 00:09:30,000
with my death.

93
00:09:30,420 --> 00:09:33,560
[A Clear Heart and an Upright Nature]

94
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:44,880
If I hadn't given the order
and approved it,

95
00:09:45,150 --> 00:09:47,510
how could those relatives of yours
in the countryside

96
00:09:47,510 --> 00:09:49,570
ever have had the nerve, or the means,

97
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,030
to do such a thing?

98
00:09:57,650 --> 00:09:59,910
I deliberately kept it from you

99
00:10:00,550 --> 00:10:03,810
and put your family up to
committing crimes.

100
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:11,850
How could it be?

101
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:13,720
How could it be you?

102
00:10:14,340 --> 00:10:16,320
You are just a fool!

103
00:10:14,450 --> 00:10:16,800
[A Clear Heart and an Upright Nature]

104
00:10:16,870 --> 00:10:19,350
You're just a lowly woman

105
00:10:20,150 --> 00:10:22,380
I picked up outside Tianhuang City

106
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:25,080
17 years ago.

107
00:10:25,150 --> 00:10:27,320
You should've died

108
00:10:27,870 --> 00:10:29,080
back then!

109
00:10:30,030 --> 00:10:31,090
Listen carefully:

110
00:10:31,270 --> 00:10:33,030
I've never loved you.

111
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:35,280
Get out!

112
00:10:43,730 --> 00:10:44,700
Your Highness,

113
00:10:44,870 --> 00:10:46,720
you kept this from me all along

114
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,720
to protect me, right?

115
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:51,260
Seventeen years ago,

116
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:55,510
I was fortunate to
have Your Highness take pity on me.

117
00:10:55,510 --> 00:10:56,910
For the rest of my life...

118
00:10:58,670 --> 00:10:59,930
I will never leave you.

119
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,630
Stop talking.

120
00:11:03,630 --> 00:11:04,440
Leave.

121
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,110
Get out!

122
00:11:40,750 --> 00:11:41,550
Who's there?

123
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:44,720
The Princess Consort
is deeply devoted to you,

124
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,670
and you

125
00:11:45,670 --> 00:11:48,400
clearly care for her
just as much, Your Highness.

126
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,360
So why

127
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:52,940
say such cruel things to hurt her?

128
00:11:54,550 --> 00:11:55,510
Lou Tianming?

129
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:57,220
How did you get in here?

130
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,670
It took some effort.

131
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,390
I killed a guard

132
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:02,780
and changed into his uniform.

133
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,510
Even so,

134
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:05,550
I could only make it

135
00:12:05,550 --> 00:12:07,750
as far as this side hall
of the Cold Palace.

136
00:12:07,750 --> 00:12:09,680
The Yuque Palace in Tianhuang City

137
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,600
is indeed heavily guarded.

138
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,510
You've...

139
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,320
come to kill me?

140
00:12:15,510 --> 00:12:16,870
Why would I kill you,

141
00:12:16,870 --> 00:12:18,030
a fallen prince

142
00:12:18,030 --> 00:12:19,630
stripped of his title?

143
00:12:20,670 --> 00:12:21,550
The Emperor may have stripped you

144
00:12:21,090 --> 00:12:25,940
[A Clear Heart and an Upright Nature]

145
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:22,840
of your title,

146
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:25,030
but once he passes away,

147
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:26,510
someone must take

148
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:29,030
the throne.

149
00:12:29,510 --> 00:12:30,910
When all is said and done,

150
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,870
your only real rival

151
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,790
is still the Crown Prince.

152
00:12:38,030 --> 00:12:39,060
Your Highness,

153
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:41,000
why not cooperate with Liluo?

154
00:12:44,510 --> 00:12:45,840
How would we cooperate?

155
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:48,050
Think about it, Your Highness.

156
00:12:48,150 --> 00:12:51,000
The Crown Prince is just a mediocrity.

157
00:12:51,510 --> 00:12:53,200
And who do you think

158
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:56,610
secured his position as Crown Prince?

159
00:13:01,630 --> 00:13:02,440
Mother,

160
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:05,440
you have wrinkles around your eyes now.

161
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,510
Is it because I

162
00:13:06,730 --> 00:13:08,810
[Zhou Ye, Grand Heir Apparent]

163
00:13:07,270 --> 00:13:09,080
make you worry every day?

164
00:13:11,150 --> 00:13:12,510
As people grow older,

165
00:13:12,750 --> 00:13:14,350
wrinkles naturally appear.

166
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:17,320
Come on, sit.

167
00:13:21,510 --> 00:13:22,720
If I never grew old,

168
00:13:22,870 --> 00:13:23,870
how could you

169
00:13:24,150 --> 00:13:25,600
ever grow up?

170
00:13:25,670 --> 00:13:27,720
Then I... won't grow up.

171
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:32,790
By the way, Mother,

172
00:13:33,670 --> 00:13:36,320
I want to go visit Grandfather.

173
00:13:36,870 --> 00:13:37,910
I wonder

174
00:13:38,150 --> 00:13:39,630
if he's any better.

175
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:44,650
Your Highness the Crown Princess.

176
00:13:47,030 --> 00:13:48,150
Your Highness the Crown Princess,

177
00:13:48,150 --> 00:13:50,810
it's time for His Highness
to take his medicine.

178
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:56,410
Your Highness the Crown Princess.

179
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:57,390
Ye,

180
00:13:57,670 --> 00:13:59,510
be a good boy
and finish your medicine first.

181
00:13:59,510 --> 00:14:00,720
Then get some good sleep.

182
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:02,250
We'll talk when you wake up.

183
00:14:22,450 --> 00:14:24,080
The little Grand Heir Apparent, Zhou Ye,

184
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:26,510
resembles the late Fourth Prince Zhou Yan
quite closely,

185
00:14:26,510 --> 00:14:28,440
in both appearance

186
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,720
and temperament.

187
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:34,440
Zhou Yan, oh, Zhou Yan.

188
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:35,960
My dear,

189
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:37,510
lovable fourth brother.

190
00:14:38,870 --> 00:14:40,870
You've been dead for so many years,

191
00:14:41,750 --> 00:14:43,870
yet you still won't leave us in peace.

192
00:14:44,100 --> 00:14:53,470
[A Clear Heart and an Upright Nature]

193
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,630
But what can

194
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:47,870
a dead man possibly do?

195
00:14:50,030 --> 00:14:51,200
Whether in the past

196
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:53,630
or now,

197
00:14:54,150 --> 00:14:56,720
when a man dies, his influence fades.

198
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:00,510
Once the little Grand Heir Apparent
is gone,

199
00:15:00,510 --> 00:15:01,510
what will that useless Zhou Tiao

200
00:15:01,510 --> 00:15:03,640
rely on to regain the Emperor's favor?

201
00:15:04,150 --> 00:15:06,080
However senile the Emperor may be,

202
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:08,200
he'd still know whom to choose.

203
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:14,570
There's no need for Your Highness
to dirty your own hands.

204
00:15:14,570 --> 00:15:16,230
I'm willing to serve Your Highness

205
00:15:16,230 --> 00:15:17,480
with all my might.

206
00:15:19,870 --> 00:15:22,360
I only hope that once Your Highness
ascends the throne,

207
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:25,080
you will help me restore Liluo.

208
00:15:37,670 --> 00:15:38,790
I'm confined

209
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,740
and cannot leave this palace.

210
00:15:40,870 --> 00:15:42,320
Only with this token

211
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:44,790
can you mobilize my men.

212
00:15:53,630 --> 00:15:55,090
Thank you, Your Highness.

213
00:16:03,740 --> 00:16:06,980
[Winter's Haven]

214
00:16:17,470 --> 00:16:20,410
[Transcendent Mastery]

215
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:37,080
Meng Rui.

216
00:16:58,360 --> 00:17:00,320
Come on, let's have a drink.

217
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:37,640
You only get a few friends

218
00:17:38,310 --> 00:17:39,400
in a lifetime

219
00:17:40,510 --> 00:17:42,710
who'd go through hell and back with you.

220
00:17:42,720 --> 00:17:44,980
I know you have a feud with the demon-men.

221
00:17:45,350 --> 00:17:46,350
But you should've

222
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:48,680
settled that with his master.

223
00:17:49,070 --> 00:17:51,400
What does that have to do
with Li Qingyang?

224
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:54,640
Do you really have to hate him so blindly

225
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:56,520
that you sever all ties with him?

226
00:17:56,590 --> 00:17:57,510
Did

227
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:59,770
the demon-men kill your whole family?

228
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:05,110
Really?

229
00:18:08,350 --> 00:18:09,160
I...

230
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:11,320
I didn't mean it that way.

231
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:17,680
To tell you the truth,

232
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:18,720
the Chief

233
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:21,320
once suspected Li Qingyang.

234
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:23,920
She even had me follow him secretly.

235
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:26,790
Actually,

236
00:18:27,720 --> 00:18:29,320
I suspected him at first too.

237
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:32,470
But that's the thing with that kid.

238
00:18:32,470 --> 00:18:34,200
He keeps everything bottled up

239
00:18:34,510 --> 00:18:36,000
and never tells us a thing.

240
00:18:36,750 --> 00:18:38,080
Suspicion is one thing,

241
00:18:38,550 --> 00:18:39,920
but if anyone dares claim that Qingyang

242
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:41,480
is an accomplice of the demon-men

243
00:18:41,480 --> 00:18:42,940
or has harmed the country,

244
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:45,160
I, Yan Cheng, will be the first to object.

245
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,090
I believe in him.

246
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,720
I'd stake my life on him.

247
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:49,070
Just based on the fact
that he risked his life to save you

248
00:18:49,070 --> 00:18:50,030
and Zhenzhu!

249
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:53,720
He's my buddy.

250
00:18:54,510 --> 00:18:55,440
I believe in him.

251
00:19:11,110 --> 00:19:20,910
[Transcendent Mastery]

252
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,030
Meng Rui!

253
00:19:20,930 --> 00:19:24,680
[Divine Constable Bureau]

254
00:19:56,750 --> 00:19:57,590
Li Si,

255
00:19:58,720 --> 00:19:59,790
I believe you're

256
00:19:59,790 --> 00:20:01,070
still alive.

257
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:04,200
Wherever you may be,

258
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:07,400
I only hope

259
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:09,970
you will overcome every danger

260
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:12,340
and remain safe and sound.

261
00:20:57,830 --> 00:20:59,070
My Lady.

262
00:21:07,510 --> 00:21:09,310
This subject wouldn't presume.

263
00:21:11,480 --> 00:21:12,310
Chief.

264
00:21:15,720 --> 00:21:17,720
Your Highness is of imperial blood.

265
00:21:18,110 --> 00:21:20,480
This subject wouldn't dare overstep.

266
00:21:39,350 --> 00:21:40,400
Xuanyuan Shan.

267
00:21:42,590 --> 00:21:46,520
This subject, Xuanyuan Shan,
pays her respects to you, Fourth Prince.

268
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:48,440
Long live Your Highness.

269
00:22:00,030 --> 00:22:00,880
Aunt.

270
00:22:04,550 --> 00:22:05,400
Yan.

271
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:18,180
Aunt,

272
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:21,750
how did you find out my true identity?

273
00:22:23,920 --> 00:22:26,650
You intentionally used
the Spice-Refining Case

274
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:28,640
to have Zhenzhu and the others find

275
00:22:28,640 --> 00:22:30,880
the puppet doll
at the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

276
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:31,680
All of that

277
00:22:32,430 --> 00:22:35,230
was so you could join
the Divine Constable Bureau.

278
00:22:35,790 --> 00:22:36,550
After that,

279
00:22:37,640 --> 00:22:39,200
you tried every possible means

280
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:41,000
to get into the Tianshu Pavilion

281
00:22:41,590 --> 00:22:44,510
to look through the case file
on Shen Baoquan's family.

282
00:22:44,510 --> 00:22:45,880
From that moment on,

283
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:49,200
I had my suspicions.

284
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:50,790
Then...

285
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:54,560
how did you find out
Meng Rui's background?

286
00:22:55,350 --> 00:22:56,350
Even if

287
00:22:56,960 --> 00:22:58,480
you'd said nothing,

288
00:22:59,350 --> 00:23:01,150
I could've guessed a thing or two

289
00:23:01,790 --> 00:23:04,250
just from seeing him
thrust his sword at you.

290
00:23:09,400 --> 00:23:11,530
If it weren't for his brother Shen Lan,

291
00:23:13,640 --> 00:23:15,550
how could I be alive today?

292
00:23:24,830 --> 00:23:25,920
I had thought that

293
00:23:27,750 --> 00:23:28,550
this time...

294
00:23:31,350 --> 00:23:33,410
I would just pay him back with my life.

295
00:23:34,790 --> 00:23:36,050
Who would have thought

296
00:23:36,590 --> 00:23:38,550
he would show me mercy?

297
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:45,470
Calm down. Calm down.

298
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:48,110
I've fed you the medicine

299
00:23:48,110 --> 00:23:49,270
Li San left behind.

300
00:23:55,310 --> 00:23:56,400
My master...

301
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:00,720
He's been buried.

302
00:24:02,790 --> 00:24:04,920
For a Liluo heretic,

303
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:08,100
that's already more mercy
than he deserved.

304
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:09,400
I only did it

305
00:24:09,520 --> 00:24:10,760
because he was

306
00:24:10,790 --> 00:24:11,880
your master.

307
00:24:13,750 --> 00:24:14,550
Precisely because

308
00:24:14,550 --> 00:24:16,200
Li San's identity was exposed,

309
00:24:16,200 --> 00:24:17,680
I became even more certain

310
00:24:18,270 --> 00:24:19,070
that you...

311
00:24:20,830 --> 00:24:21,960
are Yan.

312
00:24:25,550 --> 00:24:26,400
Back then,

313
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:28,550
at the Mulan Hunting Ground,

314
00:24:28,550 --> 00:24:30,200
he was the one

315
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:32,000
behind your kidnapping, right?

316
00:24:40,920 --> 00:24:41,720
Indeed.

317
00:24:43,550 --> 00:24:44,960
It was Li San

318
00:24:46,000 --> 00:24:47,200
who schemed to secretly

319
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:48,270
abduct me.

320
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:50,790
Later,

321
00:24:52,750 --> 00:24:54,070
he adopted me,

322
00:24:55,440 --> 00:24:56,720
raised me,

323
00:24:58,160 --> 00:24:59,400
taught me skills,

324
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:03,360
and imparted all his martial arts to me.

325
00:25:05,240 --> 00:25:06,270
He did all that

326
00:25:07,640 --> 00:25:09,160
hoping that

327
00:25:09,750 --> 00:25:11,000
one day

328
00:25:11,830 --> 00:25:14,560
he could control
the imperial court of Great Shi.

329
00:25:15,350 --> 00:25:16,160
But...

330
00:25:18,310 --> 00:25:19,640
the person who wanted to

331
00:25:21,550 --> 00:25:23,480
harm me at the Mulan Hunting Ground

332
00:25:24,720 --> 00:25:26,480
was not Li San.

333
00:25:29,310 --> 00:25:30,640
As for the real culprit,

334
00:25:31,310 --> 00:25:32,470
I think you,

335
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:34,550
my father,

336
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:37,170
and even the entire imperial court

337
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:40,000
should all know very well who it was.

338
00:25:54,750 --> 00:25:55,550
Yan!

339
00:25:57,790 --> 00:25:58,590
Yan!

340
00:26:08,790 --> 00:26:09,920
I'll find a way

341
00:26:09,920 --> 00:26:11,320
to cure you of the poison.

342
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,000
This poison

343
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:17,290
can only be suppressed.

344
00:26:17,750 --> 00:26:18,960
There is no cure.

345
00:26:22,790 --> 00:26:23,640
Unless...

346
00:26:23,640 --> 00:26:24,640
Ode to Canglang.

347
00:26:26,510 --> 00:26:28,110
I searched the Tianshu Pavilion

348
00:26:28,110 --> 00:26:29,350
for a way to cure it.

349
00:26:30,110 --> 00:26:31,350
Whatever I found,

350
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:32,200
I'm sure

351
00:26:32,750 --> 00:26:34,550
you've already looked through.

352
00:26:38,790 --> 00:26:44,390
[Heretical Tribe of Liluo]

353
00:26:53,860 --> 00:26:54,190
[Supplement to the History of Liluo]

354
00:26:54,580 --> 00:26:56,450
[Supplement to the History of Liluo;
Scroll 7, Secret Record of the Five Wonders]

355
00:27:00,310 --> 00:27:02,440
There are 2 ways to cure
the Chiying Bug Venom.

356
00:27:02,440 --> 00:27:03,200
The first

357
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:04,750
is to fight poison with poison.

358
00:27:04,750 --> 00:27:06,590
When the larvae of the Chiying bugs die,

359
00:27:06,590 --> 00:27:07,830
they turn into a plant

360
00:27:07,830 --> 00:27:09,350
called Wangliang Grass.

361
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:10,790
The juice extracted from it

362
00:27:10,790 --> 00:27:12,390
can suppress the bug poison.

363
00:27:12,790 --> 00:27:14,990
This method only suppresses the venom;

364
00:27:15,640 --> 00:27:17,030
it does not eradicate it.

365
00:27:17,030 --> 00:27:19,160
The medicine must be taken regularly,

366
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:21,220
and its effect will eventually fade.

367
00:27:22,110 --> 00:27:24,170
Wangliang Grass is neutral in nature

368
00:27:24,310 --> 00:27:25,570
and pungent in flavor.

369
00:27:25,830 --> 00:27:26,600
Isn't that

370
00:27:26,630 --> 00:27:28,160
the medicine Li San gave me?

371
00:27:31,070 --> 00:27:31,880
The second

372
00:27:32,350 --> 00:27:34,030
is the Ode to Canglang,

373
00:27:34,400 --> 00:27:37,200
one of the Five Wonders of Liluo,
which can cure it.

374
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:46,930
Only the 3 words "Ode to Canglang."

375
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:49,130
What does that mean?

376
00:27:58,200 --> 00:27:59,400
Even the Tianshu Pavilion

377
00:27:59,400 --> 00:28:01,060
has no record of how to cure it.

378
00:28:02,070 --> 00:28:03,130
Could it be that...

379
00:28:04,830 --> 00:28:06,680
I really don't have long to live?

380
00:28:07,310 --> 00:28:08,550
To cultivate the art,

381
00:28:08,640 --> 00:28:09,400
one must first

382
00:28:09,400 --> 00:28:12,480
see through the notions of self and other.

383
00:28:12,790 --> 00:28:13,750
And one must also have the good fortune

384
00:28:13,750 --> 00:28:15,400
to succeed without meaning to.

385
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:16,440
In other words,

386
00:28:16,750 --> 00:28:19,720
the practitioner must keep cultivating,
transcending illusion

387
00:28:19,720 --> 00:28:21,160
and relinquishing attachment,
while remaining

388
00:28:21,160 --> 00:28:22,490
unknowing and unaware.

389
00:28:22,830 --> 00:28:23,640
Tell me,

390
00:28:24,160 --> 00:28:26,720
how many people in this world

391
00:28:27,000 --> 00:28:29,260
could ever reach such a state of no-self?

392
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:32,720
Never mind.

393
00:28:33,590 --> 00:28:35,310
Life and death are decided by fate.

394
00:28:35,310 --> 00:28:36,310
Either way,

395
00:28:36,830 --> 00:28:37,920
I got

396
00:28:38,640 --> 00:28:40,880
17 extra years for free.

397
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:43,050
I've come out ahead.

398
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:48,440
By the way, Aunt.

399
00:28:50,920 --> 00:28:52,590
Speaking of the Tianshu Pavilion,

400
00:28:52,590 --> 00:28:54,440
there is one thing
I still don't understand.

401
00:28:54,440 --> 00:28:55,240
Go ahead.

402
00:28:57,000 --> 00:28:58,510
Why is the mural of the six gods

403
00:28:58,510 --> 00:28:59,910
of the ancient Liluo Sect

404
00:29:00,200 --> 00:29:01,000
kept in the secret chamber

405
00:29:01,000 --> 00:29:02,800
of the Divine Constable Bureau?

406
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:05,160
The late Emperor

407
00:29:05,720 --> 00:29:08,400
acquired that mural
by chance during his conquest

408
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:09,730
of the Kingdom of Liluo.

409
00:29:10,480 --> 00:29:11,270
Legend has it

410
00:29:11,400 --> 00:29:13,250
that the Holy Queen of Liluo,
Qiangong Linglong,

411
00:29:13,250 --> 00:29:14,910
cast a curse before her death.

412
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:18,130
She said that when the mural shatters,

413
00:29:18,590 --> 00:29:21,350
our Great Shi will fall with it.

414
00:29:22,920 --> 00:29:24,350
Perhaps the late Emperor

415
00:29:24,400 --> 00:29:26,130
was wary of the curse after all,

416
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:28,030
so he ordered the mural

417
00:29:28,830 --> 00:29:31,510
sealed away in the deepest part
of the Tianshu Pavilion

418
00:29:31,510 --> 00:29:33,170
and placed under heavy guard.

419
00:29:35,920 --> 00:29:37,030
I see.

420
00:29:37,510 --> 00:29:40,310
No wonder part of the mural
had already fallen away

421
00:29:40,310 --> 00:29:42,770
when I entered
the secret chamber last time.

422
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:45,030
Qiangong Linglong's curse

423
00:29:45,830 --> 00:29:46,920
is coming true.

424
00:29:48,590 --> 00:29:49,790
What do you mean?

425
00:29:56,160 --> 00:29:57,880
I saw it with my own eyes.

426
00:29:58,790 --> 00:30:00,590
After the Moluo case was solved,

427
00:30:01,110 --> 00:30:03,350
the mural of Kelu, the God of Immortality,

428
00:30:03,350 --> 00:30:04,640
shattered on its own.

429
00:30:07,200 --> 00:30:09,330
After the black chest case was solved,

430
00:30:09,790 --> 00:30:12,790
the mural of Rangnan,
the God of Prophecy, shattered.

431
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:15,960
Next,

432
00:30:16,590 --> 00:30:19,450
after the government salt case
in Mingling County,

433
00:30:20,110 --> 00:30:22,640
the mural of Qipi,
the God of Lies, shattered.

434
00:30:23,400 --> 00:30:25,530
Then, after the Lanyue Pavilion case,

435
00:30:25,590 --> 00:30:27,650
Haiqu, the God of Hatred, shattered.

436
00:30:31,240 --> 00:30:33,510
Four of the six gods are gone.

437
00:30:34,160 --> 00:30:35,920
That leaves 2:

438
00:30:36,110 --> 00:30:38,590
Qiuyu, the God of Calamity,

439
00:30:39,750 --> 00:30:41,510
and Hanluo, the God of Death.

440
00:30:42,310 --> 00:30:43,160
Calamity...

441
00:30:44,310 --> 00:30:45,110
Death...

442
00:30:48,720 --> 00:30:50,270
What could they represent?

443
00:30:51,400 --> 00:30:53,130
I wonder what kind of bloodshed

444
00:30:53,590 --> 00:30:54,710
and upheaval

445
00:30:54,730 --> 00:30:56,590
our country will go through next.

446
00:31:32,300 --> 00:31:35,330
♪ Capture my heart ♪

447
00:31:35,930 --> 00:31:39,190
♪ Unravel my longing ♪

448
00:31:38,720 --> 00:31:40,550
So it actually has its own name:

449
00:31:40,230 --> 00:31:45,510
♪ Can we relive the mark
you once carved deep? ♪

450
00:31:41,680 --> 00:31:43,110
"Severe-Cold."

451
00:31:42,090 --> 00:31:43,520
[Severe-Cold]

452
00:31:43,750 --> 00:31:45,510
What a good name.

453
00:31:45,640 --> 00:31:47,030
What was that technique you used

454
00:31:46,060 --> 00:31:49,390
♪ Turns out every soul ♪

455
00:31:47,590 --> 00:31:49,390
at the gate of Tianshu Pavilion?

456
00:31:49,590 --> 00:31:50,920
The Soaring Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation.

457
00:31:49,950 --> 00:31:53,220
♪ Fears deep devotion ♪

458
00:31:51,920 --> 00:31:52,880
I'm a constable,

459
00:31:53,200 --> 00:31:54,310
and you're a suspect.

460
00:31:54,180 --> 00:32:00,120
♪ In a moment, I fell,
a lifetime left to heal ♪

461
00:31:54,830 --> 00:31:56,160
You can explain it yourself
back at the Bureau.

462
00:31:56,160 --> 00:31:57,000
Whether or not

463
00:31:57,000 --> 00:31:58,310
you consider me a friend,

464
00:31:58,310 --> 00:31:59,110
I

465
00:31:59,960 --> 00:32:02,200
will help you uncover the truth.

466
00:32:00,580 --> 00:32:03,550
♪ Tossing and turning
through endless nights ♪

467
00:32:04,560 --> 00:32:07,460
♪ Breaking free from a labyrinth ♪

468
00:32:08,590 --> 00:32:13,860
♪ Will we meet again,
those I dare not face? ♪

469
00:32:13,510 --> 00:32:15,270
Since Dougu County,

470
00:32:14,680 --> 00:32:17,630
♪ One thought to ferry me
across the sea of suffering ♪

471
00:32:15,510 --> 00:32:16,750
wouldn't you say

472
00:32:17,240 --> 00:32:19,480
we've been through
thick and thin together?

473
00:32:17,810 --> 00:32:19,070
[Biyao Wine]

474
00:32:18,590 --> 00:32:21,490
♪ One thought to burn me to ash ♪

475
00:32:22,690 --> 00:32:28,660
♪ A thousand schemes can never be enough,
till all turn to dust ♪

476
00:32:28,750 --> 00:32:29,790
The Reaper Sword

477
00:32:28,930 --> 00:32:31,990
♪ Dare not forget ♪

478
00:32:31,270 --> 00:32:32,760
is the most sinister blade in the world.

479
00:32:32,760 --> 00:32:35,850
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

480
00:32:33,510 --> 00:32:34,920
If you take it one step further,

481
00:32:34,920 --> 00:32:36,110
you will reach the Demon Sword realm—
a state

482
00:32:36,110 --> 00:32:37,240
where all human attachments
and emotions are severed.

483
00:32:36,660 --> 00:32:42,920
♪ In love, I fear neither life nor death ♪

484
00:32:37,550 --> 00:32:38,610
When that happens,

485
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:41,110
you will lose your reason

486
00:32:41,350 --> 00:32:43,480
and become a murderous demon

487
00:32:43,720 --> 00:32:45,720
like your master, Dao Yin.

488
00:32:43,960 --> 00:32:46,860
♪ Dare not think ♪

489
00:32:47,000 --> 00:32:49,960
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

490
00:32:50,970 --> 00:32:56,840
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

491
00:32:57,730 --> 00:33:00,680
♪ I turn a blind eye ♪

492
00:33:01,150 --> 00:33:04,110
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

493
00:33:05,100 --> 00:33:11,690
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

494
00:33:13,120 --> 00:33:17,080
♪ Forever within your shadow
by your side ♪

495
00:33:13,350 --> 00:33:14,350
Slow down.

496
00:33:14,920 --> 00:33:15,680
Be careful.

497
00:33:15,680 --> 00:33:16,550
I won't take it!

498
00:33:20,920 --> 00:33:22,000
-Your Majesty, please spare us.
-Your Majesty, please spare us.

499
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:23,550
-Your Majesty, please spare us.
-Your Majesty, please spare us.

500
00:33:23,550 --> 00:33:25,000
Your Majesty, please spare us.

501
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:26,200
Imperial Physician Sun,

502
00:33:26,200 --> 00:33:27,750
please find a way quickly.

503
00:33:27,750 --> 00:33:28,920
If His Majesty doesn't improve soon,

504
00:33:28,920 --> 00:33:29,680
neither of our heads

505
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:31,110
will stay on our shoulders.

506
00:33:31,110 --> 00:33:32,720
I'll prepare the medicine at once,

507
00:33:32,720 --> 00:33:33,400
at once.

508
00:33:33,400 --> 00:33:34,350
Go, quickly.

509
00:33:34,590 --> 00:33:35,880
-Go.
-Let's go.

510
00:33:38,830 --> 00:33:39,640
Eunuch Guo.

511
00:33:40,920 --> 00:33:43,240
Greetings, Your Highness.

512
00:33:43,720 --> 00:33:44,920
What's going on?

513
00:33:45,550 --> 00:33:46,610
Does Grandfather

514
00:33:46,640 --> 00:33:47,900
feel any better today?

515
00:33:51,880 --> 00:33:52,590
Grandfather!

516
00:33:52,590 --> 00:33:55,000
-Your Highness, please listen to me.
-Your Highness.

517
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:56,960
His Majesty has specifically ordered

518
00:33:56,960 --> 00:33:58,680
that he will see no one today.

519
00:33:59,070 --> 00:34:01,720
Your Highness, please go back for now.

520
00:34:01,740 --> 00:34:04,030
But I want to check on Grandfather.

521
00:34:04,110 --> 00:34:07,110
Please don't make it difficult for me,
Your Highness.

522
00:34:08,199 --> 00:34:09,010
How about

523
00:34:09,480 --> 00:34:10,440
we just

524
00:34:10,760 --> 00:34:12,190
head back for today?

525
00:34:12,280 --> 00:34:13,070
Look.

526
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:14,860
Your Highness,

527
00:34:15,480 --> 00:34:16,840
the wind is so strong today.

528
00:34:16,840 --> 00:34:18,270
If anything were to happen to you,

529
00:34:18,270 --> 00:34:19,040
neither of us

530
00:34:19,480 --> 00:34:21,280
could bear the responsibility.

531
00:34:23,190 --> 00:34:24,000
Ye!

532
00:34:25,320 --> 00:34:26,070
Mother.

533
00:34:26,070 --> 00:34:27,280
Ye, come here.

534
00:34:30,290 --> 00:34:31,090
Mother.

535
00:34:31,320 --> 00:34:32,380
Give me your hands.

536
00:34:33,070 --> 00:34:33,880
Are you cold?

537
00:34:34,860 --> 00:34:35,380
No.

538
00:34:35,409 --> 00:34:37,489
You've come to see your grandfather again?

539
00:34:37,489 --> 00:34:40,090
Greetings,
Your Highness the Crown Princess.

540
00:34:40,510 --> 00:34:41,370
Your Highness,

541
00:34:41,469 --> 00:34:42,580
if there's nothing else,

542
00:34:42,580 --> 00:34:44,380
I'll go attend to His Majesty.

543
00:34:51,920 --> 00:34:53,570
I'm sure Eunuch Guo will convey

544
00:34:53,570 --> 00:34:56,280
your filial devotion to your grandfather.

545
00:34:56,590 --> 00:34:58,400
Instead of worrying here,

546
00:34:58,510 --> 00:35:00,300
why don't you come back with me?

547
00:35:00,360 --> 00:35:01,670
You and I

548
00:35:01,670 --> 00:35:03,200
can go to the Buddhist hall together

549
00:35:03,200 --> 00:35:04,610
and pray for your grandfather.

550
00:35:04,610 --> 00:35:05,470
How about that?

551
00:35:08,030 --> 00:35:08,840
Mother,

552
00:35:09,110 --> 00:35:10,920
I want to go to the Golden Dragon Pavilion

553
00:35:10,920 --> 00:35:13,780
to seek the Dragon Saliva Crystal
for Grandfather.

554
00:35:18,670 --> 00:35:19,480
Ye,

555
00:35:20,190 --> 00:35:23,550
I understand how you feel.

556
00:35:24,920 --> 00:35:25,760
They say

557
00:35:26,080 --> 00:35:28,510
the Dragon Saliva Crystal
of the Golden Dragon Pavilion

558
00:35:28,510 --> 00:35:31,710
can cure all diseases
and even bring the dead back to life.

559
00:35:31,710 --> 00:35:33,270
But across the country,

560
00:35:33,290 --> 00:35:36,100
who has ever actually seen or used it?

561
00:35:36,880 --> 00:35:37,980
If you ask me,

562
00:35:38,070 --> 00:35:40,510
it's just a legend.

563
00:35:40,590 --> 00:35:41,920
Even if you go,

564
00:35:41,920 --> 00:35:43,920
you'll only return empty-handed.

565
00:35:44,360 --> 00:35:45,280
Besides,

566
00:35:45,590 --> 00:35:46,880
you've never left

567
00:35:46,920 --> 00:35:48,880
this palace in your entire life.

568
00:35:49,150 --> 00:35:50,590
How could I

569
00:35:50,620 --> 00:35:52,420
rest easy knowing you're going?

570
00:35:52,480 --> 00:35:54,280
Mother, don't worry.

571
00:35:54,670 --> 00:35:55,700
I'll have imperial guards

572
00:35:55,700 --> 00:35:57,300
protecting me at all times.

573
00:35:57,550 --> 00:35:59,110
As for the Dragon Saliva Crystal,

574
00:35:59,110 --> 00:36:00,620
whether it exists or not,

575
00:36:00,710 --> 00:36:02,890
I must at least try.

576
00:36:03,110 --> 00:36:04,150
As the saying goes,

577
00:36:04,150 --> 00:36:06,670
"Unlock Heaven's mysteries,
and the Way shall be attained;

578
00:36:06,670 --> 00:36:08,280
a hundred-foot golden dragon
guards the crystal."

579
00:36:08,280 --> 00:36:09,040
The Golden Dragon Pavilion

580
00:36:09,040 --> 00:36:10,960
is the closest place
on earth to the heavens.

581
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:12,290
The late Emperor went there,

582
00:36:12,290 --> 00:36:13,940
and so did Grandfather.

583
00:36:14,550 --> 00:36:15,550
I believe that

584
00:36:15,710 --> 00:36:17,320
as long as I pray sincerely,

585
00:36:17,550 --> 00:36:19,280
the Golden Dragon King
will surely manifest

586
00:36:19,280 --> 00:36:20,210
and

587
00:36:20,240 --> 00:36:22,640
bless Grandfather with a speedy recovery.

588
00:36:42,030 --> 00:36:46,300
[The Resurrected
Shadow Puppeteer Murder Case]

589
00:36:49,750 --> 00:36:54,440
[Gutan County, Tianyuan Prefecture,
Jinzhou, Great Shi Dynasty]

590
00:36:55,230 --> 00:36:57,460
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

591
00:37:17,690 --> 00:37:19,110
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

592
00:37:18,800 --> 00:37:19,710
Out of the way, all of you!

593
00:37:19,340 --> 00:37:22,840
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

594
00:37:19,710 --> 00:37:20,590
What are you wandering around for?

595
00:37:20,590 --> 00:37:21,520
You there, halt!

596
00:37:21,640 --> 00:37:22,450
Get lost!

597
00:37:22,480 --> 00:37:23,880
What are you loitering for?

598
00:37:23,880 --> 00:37:24,480
Stop! Come here!

599
00:37:24,480 --> 00:37:25,110
What are you doing here?

600
00:37:25,110 --> 00:37:25,510
Officer,

601
00:37:25,510 --> 00:37:26,580
I'm from the coffin shop
at the west end of the street...

602
00:37:26,580 --> 00:37:27,360
Get out of sight now!

603
00:37:27,360 --> 00:37:28,310
Don't come out without good reason!

604
00:37:28,310 --> 00:37:29,110
How unlucky!

605
00:37:29,150 --> 00:37:29,960
Let's go!

606
00:37:35,280 --> 00:37:36,550
Isn't it just the Grand Heir Apparent?

607
00:37:36,550 --> 00:37:37,980
So what if he comes?

608
00:37:38,190 --> 00:37:38,960
Look,

609
00:37:38,960 --> 00:37:39,960
they've been making

610
00:37:39,960 --> 00:37:41,280
such a big fuss in the streets lately

611
00:37:41,280 --> 00:37:42,940
that nobody can live in peace.

612
00:37:43,070 --> 00:37:44,960
A couple of days ago, they even stopped me

613
00:37:44,960 --> 00:37:46,070
and demanded to see my travel permit.

614
00:37:46,070 --> 00:37:46,760
Do they

615
00:37:46,760 --> 00:37:49,160
really need to inspect us this thoroughly?

616
00:37:49,550 --> 00:37:50,880
Well, I wouldn't say that.

617
00:37:50,880 --> 00:37:52,070
Haven't you heard?

618
00:37:52,280 --> 00:37:53,800
Just a few days ago,

619
00:37:53,960 --> 00:37:56,450
the shadow puppet ghost killed again.

620
00:37:56,880 --> 00:37:57,920
Four bodies

621
00:37:57,920 --> 00:37:59,550
were found on Mount Hanhao.

622
00:37:59,550 --> 00:38:00,400
Two men and two women,

623
00:38:00,400 --> 00:38:01,920
covered in blood.

624
00:38:02,400 --> 00:38:03,320
So it really happened?

625
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,550
-Yeah.
-It's so terrifying.

626
00:38:04,550 --> 00:38:05,920
The 3 of us are from out of town.

627
00:38:05,920 --> 00:38:07,110
Aren't you a local?

628
00:38:07,110 --> 00:38:07,800
Tell us about it.

629
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:08,550
Yeah.

630
00:38:10,510 --> 00:38:12,310
You've come to the right person.

631
00:38:12,320 --> 00:38:13,920
Not only am I a local,

632
00:38:14,210 --> 00:38:15,940
but I'm also from Yin Village.

633
00:38:15,970 --> 00:38:16,510
Really?

634
00:38:16,510 --> 00:38:17,800
Alright, stop teasing us.

635
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:18,760
Get on with it.

636
00:38:18,760 --> 00:38:19,480
Here.

637
00:38:19,880 --> 00:38:21,150
Our Gutan County

638
00:38:21,150 --> 00:38:23,670
is famous for 2 things.

639
00:38:23,800 --> 00:38:26,070
Do you know what they are?

640
00:38:26,110 --> 00:38:27,390
Who doesn't?

641
00:38:27,410 --> 00:38:29,400
One is the osmanthus wine
served in glass goblets,

642
00:38:29,400 --> 00:38:30,030
and the other is

643
00:38:30,030 --> 00:38:32,400
the enchanting shadow puppet show.

644
00:38:32,400 --> 00:38:33,200
That's right.

645
00:38:33,400 --> 00:38:34,860
And this strange incident

646
00:38:35,590 --> 00:38:36,880
began with

647
00:38:37,070 --> 00:38:40,000
the enchanting shadow puppet show.

648
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:41,280
Six years ago...

649
00:38:41,360 --> 00:38:44,630
♪ Tears streamed down her cheeks ♪

650
00:38:44,840 --> 00:38:48,110
♪ The Milky Way stretched
clear and shallow ♪

651
00:38:46,960 --> 00:38:49,600
[Yin Jie, Shadow Puppeteer]

652
00:38:48,280 --> 00:38:52,630
♪ How far apart could the two shores be? ♪

653
00:38:49,770 --> 00:38:52,420
[Yin Jie's Wife]

654
00:39:00,800 --> 00:39:02,840
Come on. Get some rest.

655
00:39:06,590 --> 00:39:09,320
Hong, slow down.

656
00:39:13,510 --> 00:39:14,590
This slope is harder to climb
than I thought.

657
00:39:14,590 --> 00:39:15,360
Are you tired?

658
00:39:15,360 --> 00:39:16,070
Not at all.

659
00:39:16,440 --> 00:39:18,000
I'll go play with him for a while.

660
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:19,840
Hong! Come here.

661
00:39:21,440 --> 00:39:22,230
That's him.

662
00:39:27,590 --> 00:39:29,440
Here, have a bite.

663
00:39:31,190 --> 00:39:32,030
Is it good?

664
00:39:33,760 --> 00:39:35,780
Then let's have another bite, okay?

665
00:39:38,280 --> 00:39:39,070
Come on.

666
00:39:43,880 --> 00:39:45,140
Papa is back.

667
00:39:47,880 --> 00:39:48,670
Coming.

668
00:39:52,960 --> 00:39:54,590
Mama!

669
00:40:05,360 --> 00:40:06,440
Who are you?

670
00:40:06,550 --> 00:40:07,700
Let go of me!

671
00:40:08,280 --> 00:40:09,280
Let go of me!

672
00:40:09,400 --> 00:40:10,400
Let go!

673
00:40:14,510 --> 00:40:16,000
Mama!

674
00:40:28,510 --> 00:40:33,670
Flat hands, flat feet,
a body flat as can be.

675
00:40:34,510 --> 00:40:39,070
Yet it claims to be human, not a shadow.

676
00:40:40,150 --> 00:40:44,710
Is it a puppet performing shadow play,

677
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:50,920
or a shadow puppet wearing human skin?

678
00:40:52,960 --> 00:40:54,070
And then what happened?

679
00:40:54,070 --> 00:40:55,590
Then Yin Jie was arrested
by the county government?

680
00:40:55,590 --> 00:40:56,880
-Yeah.
-I heard

681
00:40:56,960 --> 00:40:59,000
that he was later cornered
in the Golden Dragon Pavilion

682
00:40:59,000 --> 00:41:00,600
by the county constables.

683
00:41:00,620 --> 00:41:01,920
And guess what?

684
00:41:01,920 --> 00:41:03,360
The Dragon King manifested

685
00:41:03,360 --> 00:41:04,590
and ate him.

686
00:41:04,590 --> 00:41:05,440
Ate him?

687
00:41:05,510 --> 00:41:06,760
How could the Dragon King have eaten him?

688
00:41:06,760 --> 00:41:08,510
Since Yin Jie is dead,

689
00:41:08,670 --> 00:41:10,360
this latest incident at Mount Hanhao

690
00:41:10,360 --> 00:41:11,710
can't have been his doing, right?

691
00:41:11,710 --> 00:41:13,320
That's what makes it so eerie.

692
00:41:13,320 --> 00:41:14,510
All 4 victims

693
00:41:14,510 --> 00:41:16,110
had been bound hand and foot

694
00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:17,510
and hung from trees

695
00:41:17,510 --> 00:41:18,510
like shadow puppets.

696
00:41:18,510 --> 00:41:20,260
It was exactly the same as

697
00:41:20,290 --> 00:41:21,630
what happened 6 years ago.

698
00:41:21,630 --> 00:41:22,600
Think about it.

699
00:41:22,710 --> 00:41:23,630
Who else could have done

700
00:41:23,630 --> 00:41:24,550
something like this

701
00:41:24,550 --> 00:41:26,260
besides that madman?

702
00:41:26,560 --> 00:41:28,110
Everyone in the village says

703
00:41:28,110 --> 00:41:30,000
it's Yin Jie's spirit

704
00:41:30,110 --> 00:41:31,510
coming back for revenge.

705
00:41:31,630 --> 00:41:32,840
They say that once he collects

706
00:41:32,840 --> 00:41:34,550
81 sets of hearts and livers,

707
00:41:34,630 --> 00:41:37,570
his wife and son
will be brought back to life.

708
00:41:38,320 --> 00:41:39,950
Freshly steamed buns!

709
00:41:40,030 --> 00:41:42,090
Generous filling and thin wrappers!

710
00:41:51,840 --> 00:41:52,470
[Steamed Bun Shop]

711
00:42:22,150 --> 00:42:23,670
Quick, move it.

712
00:42:23,760 --> 00:42:25,150
Quick, all of you, go help!

713
00:42:25,150 --> 00:42:27,070
Go help! Why are you just standing there?

714
00:42:27,070 --> 00:42:28,550
Hurry up! Tell them to hurry!

715
00:42:28,550 --> 00:42:29,480
Hurry up.

716
00:42:31,940 --> 00:42:36,220
[Du Zhongtao, Magistrate of Gutan County]

717
00:42:32,150 --> 00:42:32,960
My Lord,

718
00:42:33,280 --> 00:42:34,760
fortunately, we discovered them in time,

719
00:42:34,760 --> 00:42:36,400
and there were few pedestrians here.

720
00:42:36,400 --> 00:42:37,190
Otherwise,

721
00:42:37,190 --> 00:42:37,920
who knows

722
00:42:37,940 --> 00:42:39,940
how many people would've seen them.

723
00:42:40,550 --> 00:42:42,380
Nothing stays hidden forever.

724
00:42:43,000 --> 00:42:44,200
This time, we must make absolutely sure

725
00:42:44,200 --> 00:42:45,600
the news doesn't get out.

726
00:42:46,070 --> 00:42:48,030
Let's wait
until the blessing ceremony is over.

727
00:42:48,030 --> 00:42:48,840
Yes.

728
00:42:57,320 --> 00:42:58,280
My Lord,

729
00:42:58,920 --> 00:43:01,070
should we bury these bodies too?

730
00:43:01,070 --> 00:43:01,910
Bury them at once.

731
00:43:01,910 --> 00:43:03,110
Don't waste a moment.

732
00:43:03,760 --> 00:43:04,620
You must find

733
00:43:04,650 --> 00:43:05,650
a secluded place.

734
00:43:05,880 --> 00:43:08,080
Make absolutely sure
no one discovers them.

735
00:43:08,080 --> 00:43:08,920
Yes.

736
00:43:14,360 --> 00:43:15,510
Heavens above,

737
00:43:17,550 --> 00:43:18,420
please rid us of

738
00:43:18,450 --> 00:43:20,160
this vengeful spirit.

739
00:43:20,400 --> 00:43:22,800
Otherwise, my days
as Magistrate of Gutan County

740
00:43:22,800 --> 00:43:24,590
may well be numbered.

741
00:43:24,780 --> 00:43:27,140
[Shangfang Drum] [Divine Constable Bureau]

742
00:43:25,190 --> 00:43:26,320
Set out immediately

743
00:43:26,360 --> 00:43:27,480
and ride at full speed.

744
00:43:27,480 --> 00:43:29,760
You must arrive
before the blessing procession,

745
00:43:29,760 --> 00:43:31,760
find out what's really going on
in Gutan County,

746
00:43:31,760 --> 00:43:33,480
and clear all potential obstacles.

747
00:43:33,480 --> 00:43:34,960
It concerns the safety
of the Grand Heir Apparent.

748
00:43:34,960 --> 00:43:36,190
You must be extremely careful.

749
00:43:36,190 --> 00:43:38,450
There must be no negligence whatsoever.

750
00:43:39,070 --> 00:43:39,880
Yes,

751
00:43:40,070 --> 00:43:41,190
Chief!

752
00:43:42,280 --> 00:43:43,590
Take good care of Lord Meng.

753
00:43:43,590 --> 00:43:45,650
We leave the Bureau's affairs to you.

754
00:43:50,580 --> 00:43:53,020
[Chief Constable's Hall]

755
00:43:50,760 --> 00:43:51,920
Looks like the Chief

756
00:43:51,920 --> 00:43:53,330
doesn't want Meng to go this time.

757
00:43:53,330 --> 00:43:55,150
He hasn't left
Winter's Haven for 3 months.

758
00:43:55,150 --> 00:43:56,150
The whole thing with Qingyang

759
00:43:56,150 --> 00:43:57,480
hit him too hard.

760
00:43:58,320 --> 00:43:59,240
This time,

761
00:43:59,360 --> 00:44:00,360
it's on you and me.

762
00:44:00,450 --> 00:44:01,220
With me around,

763
00:44:01,220 --> 00:44:02,220
you've got nothing to worry about.
